{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07898","headline":"腊月八日於剡县石城寺礼拜 · 孟浩然","name":"腊月八日於剡县石城寺礼拜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石壁开金像，香山倚铁围。\n下生弥勒见，回向一心归。\n竹柏禅庭古，楼台世界稀。\n夕岚增气色，余照发光辉。\n讲席邀谈柄，泉堂施浴衣。\n愿承功德水，从此濯尘机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}